"about.acknowledgements.body" = "Dubawar samfuran 3D tana amfani da Open CASCADE Technology ƙarƙashin GNU LGPL 2.1 tare da banbancin Open CASCADE. An haɗa sanarwar lasisi da manhajar.";
"about.acknowledgements.openCascade" = "Haƙƙin mallaka na Open CASCADE Technology na OPEN CASCADE SAS ne da masu ba da gudummawarsa. Tushen naʼurar taimakon shigo da 3D da rubutaccen tayin tushen ɗakin karatu a bayyane suke ga kowa.";
